---
import { BookOpen } from "lucide-react";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
---

<Section id="books" title="Books">
  <article class="glow-card rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-white p-6 transition-shadow duration-300 hover:shadow-card md:p-8">
    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
      <div class="hidden rounded-lg bg-accent/10 p-2.5 sm:block">
        <BookOpen className="text-accent" size={24} />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800">大语言模型 GUI 智能体：人机交互新时代</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          <b class="font-semibold text-gray-800 underline decoration-accent decoration-2 underline-offset-2">张朝运</b>, 秦思, 李立群, 何世林
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-gray-600">
          The first book that systematically introduces GUI agents, covering perception, decision-making, action, data and applications. Funded
          by the MIIT Academic Publishing Fund (工信学术出版基金).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-accent-ink">电子工业出版社 (Publishing House of Electronics Industry), 2025</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Section>
